&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics is a leading global sports platform redefining how fans connect with the teams, players and moments they love. Our businesses — Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, Fanatics Events, Fanatics Advertising, Fanatics Markets and Fanatics Studios — maximize the presence and reach for hundreds of partners globally and create a one-stop experience that allows fans to buy, bet, collect, and earn, while engaging with sports in deeper, more immersive ways. This includes licensed fan gear and lifestyle products, sportsbook and iGaming, physical and digital trading cards, live events, premium sports entertainment content, credit card offerings and more. Together, they form a powerful, integrated ecosystem — connected by the Fanatics ONE loyalty program and FanCash, the currency of sport — delivering personalized experiences to over 100 million fans worldwide. Fanatics holds partnerships with over 900 sports properties, from professional leagues and players’ associations to teams, colleges and retail partners; over 7,000 athletes and celebrities; and over 2,000 retail locations, including all Lids stores. Backed by a team of more than 22,000 employees, Fanatics is committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Manager, Performance Creative Strategy at Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming (FBG), you are responsible for shaping the strategic priorities, audience opportunities and learning agenda behind Fanatics Markets performance creative. You&#39;ll uncover the hooks, angles and fan insights most likely to resonate, translate them into clear, inspiring briefs for the internal creative team, and track performance to understand what works and why. This role connects fan insight, creative development and performance results, ensuring learnings continuously inform future briefs across acquisition, engagement and retention. Markets and Sportsbook share many of the same fans, moments and creative systems, so you&#39;ll work in close partnership with the OSB Performance Creative team to align priorities, share learnings and avoid duplicating effort.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a six-month contract role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt; reporting to the Senior Director, Performance Creative &amp;amp; GTM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the Markets performance creative strategy across paid social, app networks, CTV, affiliates and lifecycle, aligned with business priorities, audience insight and brand positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the Markets creative variation framework, mapping hooks, angles, reasons to believe, formats and offers to audience and funnel stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives and fan insight into clear, inspiring briefs for the internal creative team, including messaging territories, hook hypotheses, angles and iteration briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Markets testing agenda, defining what we want to learn, how we measure a win, and which tests run each month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a high-velocity testing program across hooks, openers, formats, offers and creators, improving hit rate and speed to learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Media and Analytics to track creative performance, identify winners and fatigue early, and apply learnings to the next round of briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write concise test readouts and maintain a living library of what works for Markets audiences, shared with the OSB team so learnings travel across both products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify performance territories, audience tensions and messaging opportunities to support creative briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support brand and full-funnel campaign briefs with clear performance requirements, working with Integrated Marketing and Media so channel, audience, format and measurement needs are set before creative development begins. Partner with the Creative Studio to translate those requirements into effective creative, with the Studio retaining ownership of creative direction and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Brand and agency partners on hooks, edits, cutdowns, aspect ratios and platform-native versions, so big campaign moments carry through to always-on performance and lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source fan insight, competitor ad libraries, creator content and platform trends to identify new angles and white space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute a strong performance POV to creative insight sessions and brainstorms, working closely with the Creative Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share performance learnings and recommendations in GTM forums and monthly reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Deliver in Six Months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Markets testing agenda and monthly testing cadence, live within your first 30 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A documented creative variation framework for Market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A shared testing and learnings rhythm with the OSB Performance Creative team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steady flow of briefs, tests and written readouts, with winners scaled into the always-on mix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A learnings library and handover documentation so the work continues after the engagement ends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How This Role Connects Across the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners closely with the OSB Performance Creative team on shared sport moments, audiences and testing, aligning briefs and calendars, pooling learnings, and adapting proven OSB creative for Market where it fits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with the internal producer, who owns production timelines and delivery, to keep briefs, priorities and the content calendar aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with the Creative Studio and Integrated Marketing to shape high-quality output, providing direction and feedback while respecting executional ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with Brand and Integrated Marketing to embed performance best practice into campaigns, ensuring work is both distinctive and built to perform across the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with Media, Analytics and CRM to define success measures, read results and feed learnings back into strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with the affiliate team on UGC briefs aligned to channel best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works with Legal, Compliance and Creative Operations to keep all creative compliant and aligned with Responsible Gaming standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in creative strategy, performance creative or brand strategy, ideally within a fast-growing D2C brand, mobile app, sports, gaming or entertainment business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating hook-led, insight-driven creative and the performance results behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of platform-native creative across Meta, TikTok, YouTube, Snap and app networks, including UGC and creator formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running creative testing programs at volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to read performance data and translate it into clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storytelling and writing skills, from a 6-second hook to a campaign narrative to a performance readout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across matrixed teams and influencing work you don&#39;t directly own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to ramp quickly and deliver within a fixed-term engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally for team meetings and Fanatics events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connection and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-JM3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position&lt;/strong&gt;: Senior Electrical Engineer I&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Activities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the electrical design of process-module subsystems from concept through release, including schematics, cable drawings, power distribution, sensors, heaters, actuators, safety circuits, and control interfaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate process, system, safety, serviceability, and manufacturability requirements into electrical design solutions that support reliable tool operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage within multidisciplinary teams of mechanical, process, controls, software, safety, manufacturing, service, and supply chain engineers to develop integrated process module architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select and qualify electrical components based on performance, safety, reliability, availability, cost, environmental conditions, and lifecycle considerations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and review safety-related electrical systems, including interlocks, emergency-off circuits, and safety-rated components.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, review, and release engineering documentation, including schematics, cable assemblies, bills of materials, design specifications, risk assessments, test plans, and ECO packages.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support prototype builds, design verification, troubleshooting, root-cause analysis, and corrective actions for electrical issues found during development, qualification, manufacturing, or field escalation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong ownership of assigned tasks, manage priorities effectively, and communicate technical status, risks, and recommendations clearly to project stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cross-functional competencies through collaboration with multiple engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a Bachlelor/Master’s degree in Electrical Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ experience in designing and troubleshooting electrical systems for complex electromechanical equipment, preferably in semiconductor, vacuum, automation, industrial, or capital-equipment environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of electrical circuit design, power distribution, signal integrity, sensors, actuators, safety circuits, and cable assembly design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with electrical CAD tools for schematic capture and cable or harness design; AutoCAD Electrical or similar tools preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of applicable electrical safety and machinery standards such as NEC, NFPA 79, UL 508A, FM 4910, ISO 13849, EN/IEC 60204-1, EN/IEC 60204-33, and relevant SEMI standards is preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create clear technical documentation, including specifications, test plans, design notes, ECO packages, and release documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven hands-on experience in testing, installing, and troubleshooting electrical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Return/offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to develop cross-functional competencies through collaboration with multiple engineering disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to take ownership of technically challenging projects with high impact on product performance and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to contribute to the development of advanced process modules in a highly innovative, global engineering environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on state-of-the-art semiconductor process equipment and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London/Hybrid.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Type: &lt;/strong&gt;Full-time&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level: &lt;/strong&gt;Mid Level&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;EMS Engineering Lead&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team responsible for designing, building, and optimising a next-generation multi-region, multi-tenanted Execution Management System (EMS) platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have experience building concurrent, performance sensitive systems where correctness and high availability are maintained across multiple regions to meet the stringent demands of our global trading customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and implement low-latency, high-throughput systems for a multi-region, multi-tenanted EMS platform, ensuring compliance with industry standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Latency Optimisation: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyse and optimise critical paths in the system to reduce latency and improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Tenancy &amp;amp; Isolation: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop scalable architectures to ensure strong tenant isolation, data security and resource fairness in multi-tenant environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Systems: &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain distributed, fault-tolerant systems with high availability across multiple regions, ensuring data consistency and low-latency communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp; Observability: &lt;/strong&gt;Implement real-time monitoring, telemetry and alerting systems for proactive issue detection and resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with product, QA and infrastructure teams to align technical solutions with business requirements and ensure seamless deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;R&amp;amp;D: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends and incorporate emerging technologies, tools, and best practices to continuously enhance the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years of professional software engineering experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in &lt;strong&gt;low-latency&lt;/strong&gt; system design, development, and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in a compiled, statically typed language (e.g. &lt;strong&gt;C++, Rust, GO, Java or C#&lt;/strong&gt;)&amp;nbsp; Experience with &lt;strong&gt;Rust&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g. Kafka/nats, Redis, Zookeeper) and &lt;strong&gt;event-driven architectures&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;multi-tenancy patterns&lt;/strong&gt; and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms (e.g. AWS, GCP, Azure) and tools for &lt;strong&gt;multi-region deployments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of database performance tuning for low-latency access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tools (e.g. Prometheus, Grafana, ELK stack).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with a track record of working in cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and ability to work under pressure in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of crypto markets and products (Desirable).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in leveraging LLMs to accelerate delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Services experience is essential along with a background in trading/EMS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💵&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and compensation packages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎 Fully paid medical and discounted dental schemes for employees and their family&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Generous time off + bank holidays&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 Enhanced parental leave for all employees who have been with the company for one (1) year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍔 Fully stocked kitchen and access to Ubereats&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪 Discounted gym scheme with Fitness First&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🐕‍ Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 Paid study leave and personal leave&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Elwood?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join one of the fastest growing FinTech companies and help shape the future of finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A startup with deep financial backing and a strong market presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our platform is enabling institutional access to the most exciting growth opportunity in Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a modern technology stack and help solve high impact problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client-focused team with a diverse background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a Global company and have modern, centrally based offices in London, New York and Singapore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Growth at HRtechX&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world’s most demanding investors are busy managing trillions, and ignore anything average. Are you excited by the challenge of making them act?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking to work in an exceptional entrepreneurial team with ambitious, motivated and extremely driven people? And do you want real ownership from your first week? If so, now is the time to apply for the Growth role at Private Equity Insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in sprints and get fast execution under your skin. AI has completely changed the game: You will learn to deploy it to outperform a marketing team of 20+ people, while also learning the fundamentals of copywriting that makes elite investors act, get it to the right investor at a meaningful frequency and deploy what works across every marketing channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want an ambitious mission, real ownership and the fastest learning curve of your career: apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why HRtechX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRtechX is a world leading HRtech community, connecting industry executives, entrepreneurs and professionals. We are a start-up on a growth journey who help leaders evolve and create stronger businesses through people and technology. We aim to address the challenges and opportunities for HR and HR Tech. We bring together the most influential executives, investors, and entrepreneurs to share their insights on how technology will shape the future of HR, as well as forge long lasting partnerships and client relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HRtechX is part of United Media (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.united-media.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.united-media.com/&lt;/a&gt;) which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the highest bar in the world.&lt;/strong&gt; Our audience is the world&#39;s most demanding investors. They ignore anything average. If your work can make them act, you can make anyone act.&lt;/li&gt;
